{%- comment -%}
  PG Upsell Copy: RETIRED.

  This section existed to rewrite pg-unlock's offer wording from outside, every
  400ms, back when writes to pg-unlock were not reaching the renderer (the
  25-section footer-group cap, since diagnosed). The wording it patched in --
  "Buy 1 more, get 1 FREE" / "Adds 2 to your cart" -- has been pg-unlock's own
  copy for days, so every pass here was a no-op scan at best and a second
  writer to the same rows at worst. Two scripts touching the offer rows is how
  the mobile drawer ended up flickering.

  The file stays registered (overlay-group references it); it just does
  nothing. Delete the registration and this file together when convenient.
{%- endcomment -%}
